Z||000025||Slammed Fiero||05-30-2001||07:23 PM||||Just wondering , Our club had a few drags on the weekend at an airstrip after an autocross. 3 mr2's ran. 1 NA 92 , 2 88 SC's , the SC's killed the NA , and the NA is driven by a national champ , the car has a few light engine mods.. I'm going to get the video of the event this weekend and have it converted to Mpeg , also getting a 12 sec Talon Vs a low 13 sec 300zxtt , both club members<P>Perhaps it's hard to make a comparison since I have a 4spd v6 with a few light mods , turns mid to high 6's to sixty..<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1607505&a=12259132&p=48230089&Sequence=0&res=high">     <BR>Jonathan McCreery<BR>86 GT 4spd<BR>Koni's , Coilovers, Big Bars , 17" Trmotorsports Typhoons , 11.25" vented discs, Wilwood 4 Piston Calipers , Pirelli P Zero's, Short Shift, No cat , Cold air induction , Geni Stainless tips, White face gauges , Momo shift , momo pedals..Autocrossed , Tracked , abused.||||reg||1
Z||000026||banditbalz||05-30-2001||07:39 PM||||My boss has a non turbo MR2. Looks sweet, almost like a squished Ferarri. I get to drive it once a week through town. Car feels tight and has non of the interior squeeks I am use to in my GT. This 5 speed Toyota has  no where near the acceleration of my 4 speed gt. I think a turbo MR2 would be more than a race after we hit 60 mp/h.<BR>&gt; <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/banditbalz/" TARGET=_blank>www.geocities.com/banditbalz/</A> <BR><P>------------------<BR>Silver 86 GT<BR>completely stock,<BR>completely fast!||||reg||12
