Z||000034||Slammed Fiero||05-30-2001||10:08 PM||||What a sad sad narrow minded view of the auto industry... How old are you 16-17?? no offense to the younger members of the forum. IF we have everything why is GM colaborating with Toyota on a few projects. A marriage that automotive journalists say is long over due.<P>Grand national like Many GM cars is good for basically 1 reason , the motor.<P>""the wraith" american made 700hp 4cly!""<P>Skyline's are capable of 1500hp. japanese cars use technology to balance out the lack of cubes. <P>There are a few Honda NSX's (no Acura in Japan) that are prototypes. They make together 2 S2000 blocks in a V configuration change some specs , the prototypes produce 631hp from 4.3ltrs with no turbo's and idel like caddies<P>But yeah ..yee haa grand national. I don'tmean to crap on grand nationals but there old technology. I don't want to get into a big debate. Because cars like the Z06 vette are amazing. But the japanese make some killer cars too. <P><BR>JM<p>[This message has been edited by Slammed Fiero (edited 05-30-2001).]||||reg||1
