Z||000040||firstfiero||05-31-2001||10:02 AM||||     I'm not a big jap car lover but facts our facts. We build garbage! Take a gander at a consumer reports book and american cars our alway rated as crap. Honda is makeing the best engines in the world right now!!! They were always known for their reliability and now their starting to be known for speed. You have to be impressed with a 4 banger like the s2000. Honda is proving their is a replacement for displacement! Don't get me wrong I still can't comprehend the whole big wing sticker,with a big fart pipe thing going on....My fiero and I have eaten our fare share of rice! I can think of alot better cars to sup up then a honda civic dx but my parents didn't understand break dancing either... <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">...every gen. has their trends<P>------------------<BR>Hey Mr. Ricer come over here and tell me how your stickers make you faster.....<BR>         <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/headshot.gif">         <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/firstfiero.gif"> ||||reg||1
